<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Proposal
2</b>: Our stockholders ratified the appointment of Haskell &amp; White LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for
the fiscal year ending December 31, 2024 by the votes set forth below.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

