3</b>: Our stockholders approved, on an advisory basis, the compensation of our named executive officers as disclosed in the Proxy Statement
by the votes set forth below.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; text-align: center; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

